    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so cruel that we have to keep dragging this out. he's not even really in there anymore, and i'm not really \"me\" anymore either. i'm just a machine that feeds and cleans. if the door finally opens, wouldn't it just be... easier? to just be quiet and not have to fight the exhaustion every single morning? it feels like there's no real way to find rest while we're still anchored to this life.",
